1
00:00:00,240 --> 00:00:01,000
Zeus atravessou

2
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:01,360
o portal...

3
00:00:01,360 --> 00:00:02,260
e descobriu

4
00:00:02,260 --> 00:00:02,940
que existia outro

5
00:00:02,940 --> 00:00:04,590
senhor dos trovões.

6
00:00:04,800 --> 00:00:05,580
Desta vez,

7
00:00:05,580 --> 00:00:06,470
no Brasil!

8
00:00:07,190 --> 00:00:08,230
Depois de descobrirem

9
00:00:08,230 --> 00:00:08,750
que alguém estava

10
00:00:08,750 --> 00:00:10,050
conectando seus mundos,

11
00:00:10,050 --> 00:00:10,830
os quatro decidiram

12
00:00:10,830 --> 00:00:12,140
atravessar o portal.

13
00:00:12,440 --> 00:00:13,260
Mas alguma coisa

14
00:00:13,260 --> 00:00:14,330
deu errado.

15
00:00:14,560 --> 00:00:14,960
O portal

16
00:00:14,960 --> 00:00:15,720
mudou de direção

17
00:00:15,720 --> 00:00:16,620
e os lançou em uma

18
00:00:16,620 --> 00:00:18,050
floresta desconhecida.

19
00:00:19,190 --> 00:00:20,630
Árvores gigantescas,

20
00:00:20,630 --> 00:00:21,430
rios intermináveis

21
00:00:21,430 --> 00:00:22,330
e uma floresta que

22
00:00:22,330 --> 00:00:23,230
parecia observar

23
00:00:23,230 --> 00:00:24,360
cada movimento.

24
00:00:24,690 --> 00:00:26,540
Ogum percebeu primeiro.

25
00:00:26,670 --> 00:00:27,470
Havia alguma coisa

26
00:00:27,470 --> 00:00:28,680
seguindo o grupo.

27
00:00:29,290 --> 00:00:30,070
Era Anhangá,

28
00:00:30,070 --> 00:00:30,670
uma misteriosa

29
00:00:30,670 --> 00:00:31,550
entidade que,

30
00:00:31,550 --> 00:00:32,590
naquela história,

31
00:00:32,590 --> 00:00:33,210
protegia os animais

32
00:00:33,210 --> 00:00:34,280
da floresta.

33
00:00:34,690 --> 00:00:36,230
Zeus, impaciente,

34
00:00:36,230 --> 00:00:36,930
lançou um raio para

35
00:00:36,930 --> 00:00:38,120
iluminar o caminho.

36
00:00:38,410 --> 00:00:39,070
Mas seu raio

37
00:00:39,070 --> 00:00:40,760
simplesmente desapareceu.

38
00:00:41,440 --> 00:00:42,100
Então,

39
00:00:42,100 --> 00:00:42,520
um trovão

40
00:00:42,520 --> 00:00:43,620
tão poderoso fez toda

41
00:00:43,620 --> 00:00:45,010
a floresta estremecer.

42
00:00:45,790 --> 00:00:47,000
Era Tupã.

43
00:00:47,050 --> 00:00:48,070
E ele não parecia nada

44
00:00:48,070 --> 00:00:49,070
surpreso com a chegada

45
00:00:49,070 --> 00:00:50,280
dos visitantes.

46
00:00:50,940 --> 00:00:51,680
Zeus olhou para

47
00:00:51,680 --> 00:00:52,624
Xangô e disse:

48
00:00:52,624 --> 00:00:53,744
Primeiro você...

49
00:00:53,744 --> 00:00:54,774
agora mais um?

50
00:00:55,740 --> 00:00:56,959
Tupã respondeu:

51
00:00:56,959 --> 00:00:57,979
Vocês não chegaram

52
00:00:57,979 --> 00:00:59,589
aqui por acidente.

53
00:00:59,819 --> 00:01:00,859
A floresta sentiu

54
00:01:00,859 --> 00:01:02,649
a ruptura dos mundos.

55
00:01:02,980 --> 00:01:04,080
Naquele instante,

56
00:01:04,080 --> 00:01:04,920
o dia se transformou

57
00:01:04,920 --> 00:01:05,830
em noite.

58
00:01:06,060 --> 00:01:07,240
E uma figura surgiu

59
00:01:07,240 --> 00:01:08,630
sob a luz da Lua.

60
00:01:09,190 --> 00:01:10,110
Jaci mostrou que

61
00:01:10,110 --> 00:01:10,990
dezenas de portais

62
00:01:10,990 --> 00:01:11,510
estavam sendo

63
00:01:11,510 --> 00:01:12,470
abertos em diferentes

64
00:01:12,470 --> 00:01:13,860
partes do universo.

65
00:01:14,690 --> 00:01:15,730
Mas Guaraci revelou

66
00:01:15,730 --> 00:01:16,900
algo ainda pior.

67
00:01:17,130 --> 00:01:18,250
Uma força desconhecida

68
00:01:18,250 --> 00:01:18,830
estava apagando

69
00:01:18,830 --> 00:01:20,120
a luz de cada mundo.

70
00:01:21,090 --> 00:01:22,090
E foi naquele momento

71
00:01:22,090 --> 00:01:22,770
que eles ouviram

72
00:01:22,770 --> 00:01:23,530
o mesmo rugido

73
00:01:23,530 --> 00:01:24,900
do portal anterior.

74
00:01:25,940 --> 00:01:27,100
Sem hesitar, Zeus,

75
00:01:27,100 --> 00:01:27,980
Xangô e Tupã

76
00:01:27,980 --> 00:01:28,880
ergueram suas forças

77
00:01:28,880 --> 00:01:30,150
contra a escuridão.

78
00:01:31,190 --> 00:01:31,570
Quando a

79
00:01:31,570 --> 00:01:32,430
escuridão recuou,

80
00:01:32,430 --> 00:01:33,210
Anhangá retornou

81
00:01:33,210 --> 00:01:33,850
carregando um

82
00:01:33,850 --> 00:01:35,140
estranho fragmento.

83
00:01:35,690 --> 00:01:36,370
Tupã tocou

84
00:01:36,370 --> 00:01:37,650
o fragmento.

85
00:01:37,650 --> 00:01:38,590
Imediatamente,

86
00:01:38,590 --> 00:01:39,330
dois novos portais

87
00:01:39,330 --> 00:01:40,360
se abriram.

88
00:01:41,190 --> 00:01:42,310
Agora vocês precisam

89
00:01:42,310 --> 00:01:43,070
decidir para onde

90
00:01:43,070 --> 00:01:44,440
essa aliança vai.

91
00:01:44,610 --> 00:01:45,350
Cada mil curtidas

92
00:01:45,350 --> 00:01:46,250
desbloqueia uma pista

93
00:01:46,250 --> 00:01:47,440
sobre a criatura.

94
00:01:48,760 --> 00:01:50,020
Opção A:

95
00:01:50,020 --> 00:01:50,760
atravessar o portal

96
00:01:50,760 --> 00:01:51,700
congelado e descobrir

97
00:01:51,700 --> 00:01:52,120
o que Thor

98
00:01:52,120 --> 00:01:53,490
sabe sobre a ameaça.

99
00:01:54,090 --> 00:01:55,330
Opção B:

100
00:01:55,330 --> 00:01:56,070
seguir para o Egito

101
00:01:56,070 --> 00:01:56,870
e descobrir por que

102
00:01:56,870 --> 00:01:57,750
Anúbis já conhece

103
00:01:57,750 --> 00:01:58,700
o símbolo.

104
00:01:59,190 --> 00:02:00,557
Comente A ou B.

105
00:02:00,557 --> 00:02:01,870
Mas tem um problema...

106
00:02:01,870 --> 00:02:03,190
alguma coisa atravessou

107
00:02:03,190 --> 00:02:04,500
junto com eles.
